Diagnosed B-3 today. The discharge valve has failed. Discharge temperature =
is<br />
running forty-one degrees over spec and the rack has almost certainly been =
running<br />
that way for a long time - the valve plate wear is not recent.<br />
<br />
I flagged this rack internally in September. My recommendation is replaceme=
nt<br />
rather than repair: the CR-820 is a 2013 unit, parts are getting hard, and =
putting<br />
a valve in a rack this tired buys you a year at best. Quote attached.<br />
<br />
If you repair instead of replace I want that on paper, because I do not thi=
nk it<br />
holds.
